      "id": "claim_35c24f60b4fe4925b880ce1127fec940",
      "statement": "FeedService.subscribe performs an unconditional FeedFetcher.fetch(url), parses the result with FeedParser into a ParsedFeed, saves a new Feed row with pollIntervalMinutes from myfeeder.polling.default-interval-minutes, and publishes a FeedSavedEvent that triggers scheduling.",
