    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5236b260a5a44f359ab510a6c5e9a3e7",
      "statement": "FeedPollingService.pollFeed swallows any exception during polling: it increments errorCount, records lastError, and logs a warning rather than rethrowing, so a single bad poll cannot crash the scheduler thread; on success errorCount resets to 0 and lastError is cleared.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/service/FeedPollingService.java#L30-L67",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:85e32db986a975986cf74ddb2d5b36e80ed6b0fb24ee52feb2c77a7e647c018e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_06c98d239a424a74ba57b2a37a792142",
      "statement": "After each poll, FeedPollingScheduler.pollAndAdjust re-reads the feed's current error state from the DB and recomputes the effective interval: once errorCount reaches backoffThreshold (default 5), the interval becomes pollIntervalMinutes * 2^(errorCount/backoffThreshold), capped at maxIntervalMinutes (default 1440); the exponent is clamped and long arithmetic is used to avoid overflow into a negative Duration that would crash scheduleAtFixedRate.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/scheduler/FeedPollingScheduler.java#L79-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:20df92db0bc1122b868d22265b3cca6c41018f51b21c6c3dc0bd6e9f1a879d9a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b13db6b2022d401da376b48aee2b7b5c",
      "statement": "When the recomputed effective interval differs from the currently scheduled one, FeedPollingScheduler cancels and replaces the fixed-rate task with a new one starting one full interval from now, so backoff engages progressively on repeated failures and clears immediately on the next success, without any external cron sweep; interval re-evaluation is wrapped in try/catch so a transient failure there logs a warning and keeps the current schedule instead of unscheduling the feed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/scheduler/FeedPollingScheduler.java#L86-L103",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6c4d20c46ce34236f39c77b49552d2c4a2cb04e0ae10b3ea28d3ab83fb3b1827:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b9cf0db842444f92a19dc85dc72a30f7",
      "statement": "FeedPollingScheduler.pollAndAdjust self-cancels the feed's scheduled task if pollFeed throws NotFoundException, handling the case where the feed was deleted mid-flight.",
      "evidence": [
