    {
      "id": "claim_c1f9a1f44cb94160a60b295c1cc8dc1e",
      "statement": "RetentionService.cleanupOldContent runs as an independent @Scheduled cron job (default daily at 03:00, configured via myfeeder.retention.cleanup-cron) that clears content/summary text on articles older than full-content-days (default 30) via articleRepository.clearContentOlderThan; it is unrelated to the polling/backoff mechanism and never deletes rows or unschedules feeds.",
